        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: अलीकडे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अलीकडे — alīkaḍe — \"recently\". Marathi's past ends in -ले, -लो or -ली: अलीकडे मी एक पुस्तक वाचले. — alīkaḍe mī ek pustak vācle — \"Recently I read a book.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अलीकडे (alīkaḍe) is alī-, \"this side\", with -कडे, \"toward\". The origin of alī- is not settled; CDIAL has no entry for it."
            }
          ]
        },
